flowchart TD
    Start[Create Bloom Filter] --> CheckEnabled{enabled?}
    
    CheckEnabled -->|false| NoOp[Return NoOpBloomFilter<br/>Always returns true]
    CheckEnabled -->|true| CheckItems{expected_items > 0?}
    
    CheckItems -->|false| NoOp
    CheckItems -->|true| CheckStrategy{strategy?}
    
    CheckStrategy -->|ByteAligned| ByteAligned[Create ByteAlignedBloomFilter<br/>- Byte boundaries<br/>- SSTable optimized<br/>- Efficient disk I/O]
    
    CheckStrategy -->|BitPacked| BitPacked[Create BitPackedBloomFilter<br/>- u64 array storage<br/>- Memory efficient<br/>- Hash seed support]
    
    CheckStrategy -->|Simple| Simple[Create SimpleBloomFilter<br/>- Boolean array<br/>- Fast for small data<br/>- Easy debugging]
    
    CheckStrategy -->|Composite| Composite[Create CompositeBloomFilter<br/>- Multiple filters<br/>- Metadata support<br/>- Complex queries]
    
    ByteAligned --> Configure[Configure Parameters<br/>- bits_per_key<br/>- num_hashes<br/>- hash_algorithm]
    BitPacked --> Configure
    Simple --> Configure
    Composite --> Configure
    
    Configure --> Ready[Bloom Filter Ready]
    NoOp --> Ready
    
    Ready --> Operations{Operation?}
    
    Operations -->|Insert| InsertOp[Hash key with k functions<br/>Set bits at positions]
    Operations -->|Query| QueryOp[Hash key with k functions<br/>Check all positions]
    Operations -->|Serialize| SerializeOp[Create SerializedBloomFilter<br/>- Version<br/>- Strategy type<br/>- Data bytes]
    
    InsertOp --> More{More operations?}
    QueryOp --> Result[Return might_contain result]
    SerializeOp --> Bytes[Return serialized bytes]
    
    More -->|Yes| Operations
    More -->|No| Done[Complete]
    
    Result --> Done
    Bytes --> Done
    
    classDef decisionClass fill:#3b82f6,stroke:#2563eb,color:#fff
    classDef strategyClass fill:#f59e0b,stroke:#d97706,color:#fff
    classDef operationClass fill:#10b981,stroke:#059669,color:#fff
    classDef resultClass fill:#8b5cf6,stroke:#7c3aed,color:#fff
    
    class CheckEnabled,CheckItems,CheckStrategy,Operations,More decisionClass
    class ByteAligned,BitPacked,Simple,Composite,NoOp strategyClass
    class InsertOp,QueryOp,SerializeOp operationClass
    class Result,Bytes,Done,Ready resultClass